WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.578 --> 00:00:03.593
Team: UniteAndCreateForLife — Jakob Hedrich, solo builder.

2
00:00:03.593 --> 00:00:07.609
HAL LabSight: Microscopy image-quality control only — not diagnosis or biological identification.

3
00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:12.609
Architecture: OpenCV perception → policy decision → action or human recapture request; every step is traceable.

4
00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:14.828
Clean capture: The shipped UI requests a live OpenCV analysis; no response is injected.

5
00:00:15.046 --> 00:00:18.046
Observed action: First: accept; final: accept.

6
00:00:18.312 --> 00:00:20.531
Focus failure: The shipped UI requests a live OpenCV analysis; no response is injected.

7
00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.687
Observed action: First: request_recapture_focus; final: request_recapture_focus.

8
00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:26.078
Exposure failure: The shipped UI requests a live OpenCV analysis; no response is injected.

9
00:00:26.218 --> 00:00:29.218
Observed action: First: request_recapture_exposure; final: request_recapture_exposure.

10
00:00:29.437 --> 00:00:31.656
Agentic illumination recovery: The shipped UI requests a live OpenCV analysis; no response is injected.

11
00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:35.078
Observed action: First: enhance_and_reanalyze; final: accept.

12
00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:42.250
Judge suite: PASS: Four deterministic cases verify accept, two recapture actions, and CLAHE re-analysis.

13
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.015
Evidence export: A real upload and evidence download preserve request/runtime metadata without image bytes or filenames.

14
00:00:48.015 --> 00:00:55.015
Principal results — independent-source challenge: 130 scored stressor samples: 87.7% QC agreement, 16 failures, 0 unsafe accepts.

15
00:00:55.015 --> 00:01:01.046
Limits and human control: Controlled stressors are not expert ground truth or clinical validation. Review failures; recapture when requested.

16
00:01:01.046 --> 00:01:04.920
Reproducible evidence: Source-bound OpenCV 5 container, deterministic tests, receipts and hashes. This recording is not AWS evidence.
